<section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-bg-light px-6">
  <div class="container mx-auto max-w-7xl">
    <div class="mb-12 border-l-4 border-accent pl-6">
      <p class="text-xs font-bold text-accent tracking-widest uppercase">MEDICAL SCHOOLS</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-text-dark mt-2">제휴 의과대학 안내</h1>
      <p class="text-text-body mt-4 max-w-3xl">메이크닥과 파트너십을 맺은 해외 주요 우수 의과대학들을 소개합니다. 각 대학에 맞는 특화 상담과 파운데이션 과정이 마련되어 있습니다.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <% @schools.each do |school| %>
        <div class="bg-white border border-border p-6 rounded-xl hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-card-hover transition-all flex flex-col gap-4">
          <div class="text-4xl"><%= school[:icon] %></div>
          <p class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 tracking-widest uppercase"><%= school[:country] %></p>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-dark leading-snug"><%= school[:name] %></h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-body mt-auto">과정: <%= school[:duration] %></p>
          <a href="#" class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary mt-4 inline-flex items-center hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">
            자세히 보기 <span class="ml-1">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
